ort job management\n- Add template generation for CSV and Excel formats\n- Include Docker support with docker-compose setup\n- Add comprehensive API documentation with Swagger\n- Include sample data and testing scripts\n- Add security middleware and CORS configuration\n- Support multi-tenant architecture with tenant isolation\n- Add comprehensive error handling and logging\n\nThis service provides the complete backend functionality needed for\nthe lead import/export stories, enabling users to upload files and\nload lead data directly into the MongoDB database.","tree":{"sha":"aed7498b41a49562ed2856451c8e376be8c57a05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirschrockalot/ai-crm/git/trees/aed7498b41a49562ed2856451c8e376be8c57a05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirschrockalot/ai-crm/git/commits/3cd08007f4c886f6498b6a79514f59a37ea0595d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sirschrockalot/ai-crm/commit/3cd08007f4c886f6498b6a79514f59a37ea0595d","node_id":"C_kwDOPWG0qNoAKDNjZDA4MDA3ZjRjODg2ZjY0OThiNmE3OTUxNGY1OWEzN2VhMDU5NWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sirschrockalot/ai-crm/commit/d920c5308198f7d8d784f0834a54c2464a44debb","sha":"d920c5308198f7d8d784f0834a54c2464a44debb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirschrockalot/ai-crm/commits/d920c5308198f7d8d784f0834a54c2464a44debb"}],"sha":"3cd08007f4c886f6498b6a79514f59a37ea0595d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirschrockalot/ai-crm/commits/3cd08007f4c886f6498b6a79514f59a37ea0595d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sirschrockalot/ai-crm/commits/d920c5308198f7d8d784f0834a54c2464a44debb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-10T21:09:43Z","email":"joel.schrock@carrier.com","name":"Joel Schrock"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-10T21:09:43Z","email":"joel.schrock@carrier.com","name":"Joel Schrock"},"message":"feat: Add comprehensive Global Navi