://api.github.com/users/Kwaadpepper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kwaadpepper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kwaadpepper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kwaadpepper/P13-POC-Your-Car-Your-Way/commits/42cd83bc26c1641ecfb47bafd45936d62a3fa79b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-16T10:48:39Z","email":"github@jeremydev.ovh","name":"Jérémy Munsch"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-16T10:48:39Z","email":"github@jeremydev.ovh","name":"Jérémy Munsch"},"message":"feat(back): initialize backend structure with Spring Boot microservices\n\n- Added .editorconfig for consistent coding styles across the project.\n- Created .gitattributes to manage line endings for different environments.\n- Introduced .gitignore to exclude build artifacts and IDE-specific files.\n- Removed unnecessary .gitkeep file.\n- Set up Maven Wrapper with maven-wrapper.properties and scripts for easier Maven management.\n- Configured application.yml for management and logging settings.\n- Created user-service.yml for database connection configuration.\n- Added docker-compose.yml to define RabbitMQ and PostgreSQL services.\n- Implemented config-server module with necessary dependencies and application configuration.\n- Developed gateway module with Spring Cloud Gateway and Eureka client support.\n- Established service-registry module with Eureka server configuration.\n- Created user-service module with REST controller and database access.\n- Defined parent pom.xml for dependency management and module structure.","tree":{"sha":"abaab506825c0fc05f00a6812ce5c3fd312583de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kwaadpepper/P13-POC-Your-Car-Your-Way/git/trees/abaab506825c0fc05f00a6812ce5c3fd312583de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kwaadpepper/P13-POC-Your-Car-Your-Way/git/commits/42cd83bc26c1641ecfb47bafd45936d62a3fa79b","verification":{"payload":"tree abaab506825c0fc05f00