count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-03T00:59:51Z","email":"leticiarosadeoliveira@yahoo.com.br","name":"Leticia Rosa"},"message":"feat: enhance mfe-menu with new routes and components\n\n- Added new routes for \"Investimentos\", \"Outros Serviços\", and \"Transferências\" with corresponding pages.\n- Updated the main application entry point to clear existing content for hydration consistency.\n- Refactored the root route to include a SidebarProvider for better layout management.\n- Improved the index route with a new dashboard layout and enhanced UI components.\n- Introduced a detailed layout for the \"Investimentos\" page, showcasing investment summaries and opportunities.\n- Created a comprehensive \"Outros Serviços\" page with various service options and notifications.\n- Developed a user-friendly \"Transferências\" page for managing transfers with a recent transactions history.\n- Updated Vite configuration to expose necessary modules and adjusted server settings.\n- Enhanced the UI library by adding new sidebar components and refining existing ones for better usability.","tree":{"sha":"04cb6dc50ddc6ee0af60bb3a89d48eb7d4f9ff85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/ByteBank-TurboRepo/git/trees/04cb6dc50ddc6ee0af60bb3a89d48eb7d4f9ff85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/ByteBank-TurboRepo/git/commits/b93b5473f947c96b79a79ac23d0e8e3bcd668c1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37852713?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeticiaRosa","id":37852713,"login":"LeticiaRosa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3ODUyNz