rs/LeticiaRosa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/ByteBank-TurboRepo/commits/4b4cfdd93013528fed480140e346cc7f585153d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-02T23:15:54Z","email":"leticiarosadeoliveira@yahoo.com.br","name":"Leticia Rosa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-02T23:15:54Z","email":"leticiarosadeoliveira@yahoo.com.br","name":"Leticia Rosa"},"message":"feat: migrate to @module-federation/vite and update shared dependencies\n\n- Updated Vite configuration in mfe-auth and mfe-menu to use @module-federation/vite.\n- Added singleton configuration for shared dependencies in both applications.\n- Created localSharedImportMap.js for mfe-menu to address Windows compatibility.\n- Updated package.json for mfe-menu to include @module-federation/vite and updated @tanstack/react-query to version 5.84.1.\n- Introduced ReactQueryDevtools in mfe-menu for enhanced debugging.\n- Implemented a QueryClientProvider in mfe-menu to manage query client context.\n- Updated main.tsx in mfe-menu to integrate TanStack Query Provider and Toaster.\n- Refactored UI components in the @bytebank/ui package to improve code consistency and readability.\n- Updated pnpm-lock.yaml to reflect new dependencies and versions.","tree":{"sha":"58d13795df6bb04b3e5dea59ff41b8a5190c609c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/ByteBank-TurboRepo/git/trees/58d13795df6bb04b3e5dea59ff41b8a5190c609c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/ByteBank-TurboRepo/git/commits/4b4cfdd93013528fed480140e346cc7f585153d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37852713?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/following{/other_user}","gists