/alias on Linux). Add environment\nrefresh/source steps after Bun installs for both Windows and Linux.\n\nImprove Debian-based VSCode install: add Microsoft GPG key, add\nrepository, update apt, then install the ''code'' package instead of\nusing a placeholder install_package call.\n\nFix typos and housekeeping:\n- Remove unused regex import in instructions.rs.\n- Update Windows Docker base image reference to mcr.microsoft.com.\n- Simplify machine architecture default handling and emit a clearer\n  warning when falling back to x86_64.","tree":{"sha":"335efab6b2b45120e17c3f2d85470be5a8681001","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/trees/335efab6b2b45120e17c3f2d85470be5a8681001"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/commits/2c8ebfa35d276df4f124a6a66df18b60711f84c4","verification":{"payload":"tree 335efab6b2b45120e17c3f2d85470be5a8681001\nparent 80818a77530746a5a5a38a212c75e3f56d7e4a11\nauthor JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1755552469 +0200\ncommitter JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1755552469 +0200\ngitbutler-headers-version 2\ngitbutler-change-id 3b9e9d89-3f17-4d5e-99b9-71beb23bb79d\n\nfeat: update installation instructions cleanup defaults\n\nactor Node.js/Bun/VSCode install instructions to use platform-\nappropriate installers and environment refresh steps. Replace\nWindows nvm/linux nvm multi-step commands with single, reliable\ncommands (nvm-windows installer & silent install, refreshenv;\ncombined nvm source/install/use/alias on Linux). Add environment\nrefresh/source steps after Bun installs for both Windows and Linux.\n\nImprove Debian-based VSCode install: add Microsoft GPG key, add\nrepository, update apt, then install the ''code'' package instead of\nusing a placeholder install_package call.\n\nFix typos and housekeeping:\n- Remove unused regex import in instructions.rs.\n- Update Windows Docker base image reference to mcr.microsoft.com.\n- Simplify 