ps://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JackatDJL","id":71508487,"login":"JackatDJL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNTA4NDg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/commits/a4f5db3af07963ea53754f4e6fbfc566c1b87f76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-06T21:51:12Z","email":"71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JackatDJL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-13T19:14:02Z","email":"71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JackatDJL"},"message":"feat(setup): Implement dry-run capability and refactor instruction handling\n\nThis commit introduces a major new feature and refactoring to the projektwoche-setup crate.\n\n   - Dry-Run Mode: A dry_run parameter has been added to the run method of all instructions. When enabled, the setup process will print the actions it would take without actually executing them. This is useful for\n     debugging and ensuring the setup will perform the correct steps.\n\n   - Instruction Refactoring: The instruction handling logic has been significantly refactored to be more cross-platform and flexible.\n       - Removed most of the #[cfg(windows)] and #[cfg(unix)] conditional compilation attributes in favor of more robust platform-specific logic within the instruction implementations.\n       - The DownloadAndExec instruction now dynamically determines how to handle downloaded files based on their extension, rather than relying on a predefined file type.\n\n   - Standardized Node.js Installation: The Node.js installation process has been updated to use nvm (Node Version Manager) on all supported platforms (Windows, macOS, and Linux) for a more consistent and reliable\n     setup.\n\n   - VSCode on RHEL: Added support for installing Visual Studio Code on RHEL-based Linux distributions.","tree":{"sha":"a26ef086ba2447b191995086f3583ea05638f8ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/trees/a26ef086ba2447b191995086f3583ea05638f8ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/commits/a4f5db3af07963ea53754f4e6fbfc566c1b87f76","verification":{"payload":"tree a26ef086ba2447b191995086f3583ea05638f8ca\nparent 1200bc8449fb080506b2fd3e2f3b5d664ab00b0b\nauthor JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1754517072 +0200\ncommitter JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1755112442 +0200\ngitbutler-headers-version 2\ngitbutler-change-id a7e83bf7-cb68-472f-8a67-ff2324a21193\n\nfeat(setup): Implement dry-run capability and refactor instruction handling\n\nThis commit introduces a major new feature and refactoring to the projektwoche-setup crate.\n\n   - Dry-Run Mode: A dry_run parameter has been added to the run method of all instructions. When enabled, the setup process will print the actions it would take without actually executing them. This is useful for\n     debugging and ensuring the setup will perform the correct steps.\n\n   - Instruction Refactoring: The instruction handling logic has been significantly refactored to be more cross-platform and flexible.\n       - Removed most of the #[cfg(windows)] and #[cfg(unix)] conditional compilation attributes in favor of more robust platform-specific logic within the instruction implementations.\n       - The DownloadAndExec instruction now dynamically determines how to handle downloaded files based on their extension, rather than relying on a predefined file type.\n\n   - Standardized Node.js Installation: The Node.js installation process has been updated to use nvm (Node Version Manager) on all supported platforms (Windows, macOS, and Linux) for a more consistent and reliable\n     setup.\n\n   - VSCode on RHEL: Added support for installing Visual Studio Code on RHEL-based Linux distributions.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEPe7opfFXBbOntsY/zhGGnpWe2kEFAmic4/wACgkQzhGGnpWe\n2kFA6w//Rkk2wS2D8p98FcBzAVwSbM/Bv0zZu+HjF6LQkRfENGVIwMeAJdowJujg\n4yTOWZJmZ8nZiNulyWxZBva5/XPhxB4kZCr3gCnodVKv7C8vzK+3grBzQeMJ8arv\nDndzHhYeS4rwzxAJeOro63mqnMjSKfYWz1N/MZxjI4xKGc065D8LH/hylqMzLI7y\n1vQKuuZ2KtLmXorESbVzwyRA76WqQ2j3ZlAsCrJQhTlSgfeqF+GJVTobgQ7MiNEu\nB/5eQF2tmtwie83tbBiUClgeflaNHSzvG8rTsTkb6WJPrvC3MZYyCsn1qZS+MM4/\nM59xFwMQm1oLUnzLl3o77WoFFW0sLGA3KL9q8n1xm7AUwUSRrsMXXzdIV9U7VU+a\n+Y7kZhOiSxetUcU46pmqKYYvwge3NdyJnu+9htqQhKy3exuIe/x0foPS6VWGN0E6\nI4NAghI05R1/XQBPEKYRFPPhnegEhIcAX2TVK2gxHx8wANkLglLVE2u3KrGl81u2\nDWjzpc3bqDRi/LQuAZxh4T1jroaAK0ji4rQ7kY0oUgRnbfb0t/MZ40l5MrSfnsDr\nVRvMPRimNmvWLeiQZ3AvWTLdcCf1nyOVu4qNQfpT+txYMw6VLz5Ml4K++tBqegiL\ntefVZ0J33LbmBqloMMSH4cLJMigZwOgh/c4thP7eyeXbKlyoNbo=\n=REvB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-08-13T19:14:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71508487?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JackatDJL","id":71508487,"login":"JackatDJL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNTA4NDg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/commit/a4f5db3af07963ea53754f4e6fbfc566c1b87f76","node_id":"C_kwDOPXRq5doAKGE0ZjVkYjNhZjA3OTYzZWE1Mzc1NGY0ZTZmYmZjNTY2YzFiODdmNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/commit/1200bc8449fb080506b2fd3e2f3b5d664ab00b0b","sha":"1200bc8449fb080506b2fd3e2f3b5d664ab00b0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/commits/1200bc8449fb080506b2fd3e2f3b5d664ab00b0b"}],"sha":"a4f5db3af07963ea53754f4e6fbfc566c1b87f76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/commits/a4f5db3af07963ea53754f4e6fbfc566c1b87f76"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71508487?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JackatDJL","id":71508487,"login":"JackatDJL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNTA4NDg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/commits/1200bc8449fb080506b2fd3e2f3b5d664ab00b0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-06T17:29:51Z","email":"71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JackatDJL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-13T19:14:02Z","email":"71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JackatDJL"},"message":"Moved the Packages to Own Module\n\nRefactor OS type references to use config::machine::OS consistently.\nIntroduce uninstaller and deconfigurator functions with threaded execution\nto handle package uninstallation and deconfiguration steps. These new\nfeatures improve lifecycle management by enabling clean removal and\nreversal of configurations for installed programs. Error handling and\nlogging are added to track execution success or failure.","tree":{"sha":"fcf768a5d2d7bcfe4bedf1a6afad836f9c8993d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/trees/fcf768a5d2d7bcfe4bedf1a6afad836f9c8993d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/commits/1200bc8449fb080506b2fd3e2f3b5d664ab00b0b","verification":{"payload":"tree fcf768a5d2d7bcfe4bedf1a6afad836f9c8993d3\nparent 90436c0d2d50bbb167590f6503fb8aefd8903cc6\nauthor JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1754501391 +0200\ncommitter JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1755112442 +0200\ngitbutler-headers-version 2\ngitbutler-change-id f5e3718e-2d2d-4222-81f8-d12c194fd9ff\n\nMoved the Packages to Own Module\n\nRefactor OS type references to use config::machine::OS consistently.\nIntroduce uninstaller and deconfigurator functions with threaded execution\nto handle package uninstallation and deconfiguration steps. These new\nfeatures improve lifecycle management by enabling clean removal and\nreversal of configurations for installed programs. Error handling and\nlogging are added to track execution success or failure.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEPe7opfFXBbOntsY/