 working; e.g. commit\n\n- web: load Google font and apply to <body> alongside GeistSans\n  (/web/src/app/layout.tsx)\n  - Introduce next/font/google Ledger with latin subset and weight 400.\n  - Add ledger.className to the body to apply the new font site-wide.\n  - Purpose: improve typography and visual identity.\n\n- turbo: add chill-build pipeline and configure inputs/envs\n  (turbo.json, apps/web/turbo.json)\n  - Add a \"chill-build\" task that depends on lint/check and ^build.\n  - Configure inputs and environment variables required for the task.\n  - Purpose: provide an alternative build task with lint gating and\n    explicit env inputs.\n\n- eslint-config: fix outputs, exports, tsconfig and package paths\n  (packages/eslint-config/turbo.json, packages/eslint-config/tsconfig.json,\n  packages/eslint-config/package.json)\n  - Broaden build outputs pattern exclusion to eslint.config.*.\n  - Set JSX to react-jsx and tidy include/exclude globs.\n  - Adjust package export paths to point to compiled files under dist/.\n  - Purpose: correct build artifacts, TypeScript JSX handling and module\n    exports for proper packaging and consumption.\n\n- ui: tweak footer colors and foreground usage\n  (packages/ui/src/layout/footer.tsx)\n  - Replace gradient color tokens with explicit hex stops.\n  - Switch many \"text-muted-foreground\" classes to \"text-foreground\".\n  - Purpose: increase color contrast and ensure consistent readable text\n    in the footer across themes and print mode.","tree":{"sha":"6bd2383d33f170b8a42c80497e07daae8ac15465","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/trees/6bd2383d33f170b8a42c80497e07daae8ac15465"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/commits/4c2c2843f9473fd756add85b47fe3d01d82f79a9","verification":{"payload":"tree 6bd2383d33f170b8a42c80497e07daae8ac15465\nparent a1f769f0deb8d5f646165972712899db9db0ca2a\nauthor JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1755019522 +0200\ncommitter JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1755019603 +0200\ngitbutler-headers-version 2\ngitbutler-change-id 60ab27b7-d6bf-447d-9775-1cf27bc6da18\n\ni was working on styles; ui forgot to react; now its working; e.g. commit\n\n- web: load Google font and apply to <body> alongside GeistSans\n  (/web/src/app/layout.tsx)\n  - Introduce next/font/google Ledger with latin subset and weight 400.\n  - Add ledger.className to the body to apply the new font site-wide.\n  - Purpose: improve typography and visual identity.\n\n- turbo: add chill-build pipeline and configure inputs/envs\n  (turbo.json, apps/web/turbo.json)\n  - Add a \"chill-build\" task that depends on lint/check and ^build.\n  - Configure inputs and environment variables required for the task.\n  - Purpose: provide an alternative build task with lint gating and\n    explicit env inputs.\n\n- eslint-config: fix outputs, exports, tsconfig and package paths\n  (packages/eslint-config/turbo.json, packages/eslint-config/tsconfig.json,\n  packages/eslint-config/package.json)\n  - Broaden build outputs pattern exclusion to eslint.config.*.\n  - Set JSX to react-jsx and tidy include/exclude globs.\n  - Adjust package export paths to point to compiled files under dist/.\n  - Purpose: correct build artifacts, TypeScript JSX handling and module\n    exports for proper packaging and consumption.\n\n- ui: tweak footer colors and foreground usage\n  (packages/ui/src/layout/footer.tsx)\n  - Replace gradient color tokens with explicit hex stops.\n  - Switch many \"text-muted-foreground\" classes to \"text-foreground\".\n  - Purpose: increase color contrast and ensure consistent readable text\n    in the footer across themes and print mode.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEPe7opfFXBbOntsY/zhGGnpWe2kEFAmibeVMACgkQzhGGnpWe\n2kETRxAAqObC/w4tvbvJ5gDHNTG5y8VWSW4BK4wAKk+MJFUUgPpftylwnBuVg56q\nopmNo42dD5PZC81WTT03COX61EKPJ3+wpIKR4pjtvO1sFyoB581LrSaBtIxVQKDu\npl