e)\nso the Astro app has an entry page. Fix the dev script to pass the\nmicrofrontends port flag and add path aliases in tsconfig for simpler\nimports.\n\nIntroduce a new packages/tailwind-config workspace package (exports\nglobals.css and postcss config) and wire it into apps/web devDeps\n(prowo-wind). Also enable turbopack in web next.config and remove a\ncached .next outputs entry from turbo.json to avoid publishing build\ncache. These changes standardize styling config and update build/dev\ntooling.","tree":{"sha":"4769b5a7b8c8186856b3737bd2ee771a46861642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/trees/4769b5a7b8c8186856b3737bd2ee771a46861642"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/commits/a1f769f0deb8d5f646165972712899db9db0ca2a","verification":{"payload":"tree 4769b5a7b8c8186856b3737bd2ee771a46861642\nparent 512d595bd9fd86c8eba07cfbcbfb9c15acf940e6\nauthor JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1754938725 +0200\ncommitter JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1754938725 +0200\ngitbutler-headers-version 2\ngitbutler-change-id 26536bc6-26c3-47f4-bd7e-a3c84d2e4fd7\n\nstill ts-issue; styles working, microfrontend working\n\nRemove the remnants of the projekte-svelte app (config, package,\nREADME, app.html,npmrc, .ignore) and related SvelteKit/Vite\nsettings that not needed. This cleans up dead files and avoids\ncarrying obsolete configuration for Svelte microfrontends.\n\nAdd a basic Astro page for apps/projekte (PostHogLayout + Welcome)\nso the Astro app has an entry page. Fix the dev script to pass the\nmicrofrontends port flag and add path aliases in tsconfig for simpler\nimports.\n\nIntroduce a new packages/tailwind-config workspace package (exports\nglobals.css and postcss config) and wire it into apps/web devDeps\n(prowo-wind). Also enable turbopack in web next.config and remove a\ncached .next outputs entry from turbo.json to avoid publishing build\ncache. These chan