tps://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/commits/3e58d096c295f951bd34d6b4184c7c28a44eba89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-11T16:26:10Z","email":"71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JackatDJL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-11T16:26:10Z","email":"71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JackatDJL"},"message":"I STILL CANT Fkng GET THAT NONSENSE TYPEERROR TO WORK\n\n- Initialize posthog in Global Error component and capture exceptions.\n  - Import env and callhog.init with API/ui hosts, profile/Capture\n    options, and debug flag. This ensures errors are reported reliably to\n    PostHog and configures capture behavior consistently.\n- Rename GlobalError component to Error and keep rendering NextError.\n- Add public-hoist-pattern entries to apps/web/.npmrc to prevent hoisting\n  react and react-dom.\n- Stabilize TRPC hydration exports to avoid complex type inference:\n  - Create a typed hydration constant and export api and HydrateClient from\n    it to preserve precise types.\n- Swap devModeFlag and env.NODE_ENV usage in RootLayout to await remote\n  feature flag and use env for NODE_ENV check, aligning initialization\n  order.\n- Make not-found a client component wrapper that returns the NotFound UI.\n- Align various package and dependency versions:\n  - Bump next to a canary patch, increment react/react-dom/typescript\n    typings in web package, and set specific @types/react versions in\n    other manifests and bun.lock to reduce version skew.\n- Tighten TRPC React typing by annotating api export return type.\n- Add jsxImportSource to react-library tsconfig to support JSX runtime.\n\nThese changes improve error tracking, type stability, and package version\nconsistency across the monorepo.","tree":{"sha":"b54947ad6633b5caf143351501ff86adcd2804ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/trees/b54947ad6633b5caf143351501ff86adcd2804ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/commits/3e58d096c295f951bd34d6b4184c7c28a44eba89","verification":{"payload":"tree b54947ad6633b5caf143351501ff86adcd2804ca\nparent efe7028ee9a6a03e77391bb4be13ae3331661e29\nauthor JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1754929570 +0200\ncommitter JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1754929570 +0200\ngitbutler-headers-version 2\ngitbutler-change-id 2b873dc3-f2a0-43ba-bd49-8a4d2a037b26\n\nI STILL CANT Fkng GET THAT NONSENSE TYPEERROR TO WORK\n\n- Initialize posthog in Global Error component and capture exceptions.\n  - Import env and callhog.init with API/ui hosts, profile/Capture\n    options, and debug flag. This ensures errors are reported reliably to\n    PostHog and configures capture behavior consistently.\n- Rename GlobalError component to Error and keep rendering NextError.\n- Add public-hoist-pattern entries to apps/web/.npmrc to prevent hoisting\n  react and react-dom.\n- Stabilize TRPC hydration exports to avoid complex type inference:\n  - Create a typed hydration constant and export api and HydrateClient from\n    it to preserve precise types.\n- Swap devModeFlag and env.NODE_ENV usage in RootLayout to await remote\n  feature flag and use env for NODE_ENV check, aligning initialization\n  order.\n- Make not-found a client component wrapper that returns the NotFound UI.\n- Align various package and dependency versions:\n  - Bump next to a canary patch, increment react/react-dom/typescript\n    typings in web package, and set specific @types/react versions in\n    other manifests and bun.lock to reduce version skew.\n- Tighten TRPC React typing by annotating api export return type.\n- Add jsxImportSource to react-library tsconfig to support JSX runtime.\n\nThese changes improve error tracking, type stability, and package version\nconsistency across the monorepo.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEPe7opfFXBbOntsY/zhGGnpWe2kEFAmiaGaIACgkQzhGGnpWe\n2kE68BAAhQp8e5/eR2v/Prh8I4xJfuU1BiNyAoxERNGbGsyacAtVjAnCRKk8fn+P\nCnMqNNB2x0cAgVII6PcJEzW7KbNEBfJaSPTYPfMe95i0Qa189R9B/FDMtZxiq7CA\nQKMzBw4pWYWCTFx8iYbwGWj9nZFdpTIVeLzv/bjAEeFOOwMJB2Tyhhky+0Dus4Gw\ng8w+JFoK1snq+VkMCSSHF9udDacucvR8ToraJ0vdThLTghFnDTYAS30kfhBFF/WG\neJYQNZwd+RZ09hi1fA8CHHU37OFEzzYDXEeFjoFZRaCxToKbIlbrULEVFUmvnrMT\nk6jpZZNXtG+7CXhQiwIfbIEf+2a5ms5UeHZ1iP3gDvhiSfJhQHxZhGSKtQdI6Kiq\ndZp5Y9k9XIXKLcmRpb/Li/HCJcabua1rzcOkBEUFubGVJ/pICg/NNxIy+05ohNtF\n8zlqzMiOc2GrkhKN07JVdN23OuZUpPEm4hlo1aNj/z7iZlrg0lQFzjJatdZ03AV1\nKZz7uFxUnYQEiZiWLUSToShe6dzi4Rw8YDoojm3npLtd/61h0RbauBDMdGwQymH4\nVikvj7LKJpuHE9VIKfq2K/fSMS7N6hkEsn6GakrgzD91TS7+q6BNyalvEnRyl4sl\nQ3+CtmYxcTpxZnTTJH3WuLwYIA0uV1NGYetlRiJV7CxABqrbpzM=\n=xu4z\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-08-11T16:26:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71508487?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JackatDJL","id":71508487,"login":"JackatDJL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNTA4NDg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/commit/3e58d