to use relative paths so bundled modules\n  resolve correctly at runtime: Header, and Toaster now import\n  from ./layout/* and ./ui/sonner instead of app-root aliases.\n- Add a new Astro Welcome component (apps/projekte/src/components/\n  Welcome.astro) providing a hero section, links, and a \"What''s New\"\n  promo card with accompanying styles and assets. This introduces\n  markup, SVG icons, background image and CSS for layout and theming.\n\nThese changes fix import resolution issues and add a starter welcome\npage for the Astro app to guide users and surface recent updates.","tree":{"sha":"5d19cafb2762e61f3f06645a85c57833281c8cfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/trees/5d19cafb2762e61f3f06645a85c57833281c8cfc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/commits/efe7028ee9a6a03e77391bb4be13ae3331661e29","verification":{"payload":"tree 5d19cafb2762e61f3f06645a85c57833281c8cfc\nparent 4887b2c41e11735ffe7f406785d8d74f0c705117\nauthor JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1754853871 +0200\ncommitter JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1754853871 +0200\ngitbutler-headers-version 2\ngitbutler-change-id 5980a474-2902-490e-96c1-1b5405311d4d\n\ntesting out frameworks for hosting projects\n\n- Update UI layout imports to use relative paths so bundled modules\n  resolve correctly at runtime: Header, and Toaster now import\n  from ./layout/* and ./ui/sonner instead of app-root aliases.\n- Add a new Astro Welcome component (apps/projekte/src/components/\n  Welcome.astro) providing a hero section, links, and a \"What''s New\"\n  promo card with accompanying styles and assets. This introduces\n  markup, SVG icons, background image and CSS for layout and theming.\n\nThese changes fix import resolution issues and add a starter welcome\npage for the Astro app to guide users and surface recent updates.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEPe