napps/projekte/.prettierrc). Introduce PostCSS config for web (apps/web/postcss.config.js).\n\nReplace and add public SVG assets for apps/web and remove an obsolete\nvercel.svg. Add placeholder and window assets adjustments (apps/web/public,\napps/projekte/public).\n\nSwitch apps/web eslint export to use prowo-lint/next default export for\nconsistent linting (apps/web/eslint.config.js).\n\nAdd a lightweight Skeleton UI component and an unauthorized page stub\nto the UI package (packages/ui/src/ui/skeleton.tsx,\npackages/ui/src/pages/unauthorised.tsx) to support loading states and\nauth handling in the frontend.\n\nAdd Next.js configuration with rewrites, experimental flags, Vercel\ntoolbar, microfrontends and BotID integrations to apps/web (apps/web/next.config.ts).\nThis centralizes runtime routes and third-party integrations.\n\nOverall, align formatting rules, introduce shared configs, add UI\nbuilding blocks and update web app runtime and assets to support the\nnew frontend features and integrations.","tree":{"sha":"53a1819d8a659746c8081ff3bfe9f014d1b8e17b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/trees/53a1819d8a659746c8081ff3bfe9f014d1b8e17b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/commits/4887b2c41e11735ffe7f406785d8d74f0c705117","verification":{"payload":"tree 53a1819d8a659746c8081ff3bfe9f014d1b8e17b\nparent 8cba639acc20fa0d37af7b66079d167fd73f0a20\nauthor JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1754765643 +0200\ncommitter JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1754765643 +0200\ngitbutler-headers-version 2\ngitbutler-change-id 0431077d-c906-49b8-96b2-553c04f674c2\n\nnextjs setup, having issues with ui imports\n\nAdd TypeScript and Prettier configs for packages and apps to standardize\ntooling (packages/eslint-config/tsconfig.json, packages/*/.prettierrc,\napps/projekte/.prettierrc). Introduce PostCSS config for web (apps/web/postcss.config.js).\n\nReplace and add public 