8a8522c635","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/trees/faa7726122b8de4490c1c4aab7b49b8a8522c635"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DJL-Foundation/projektwoche/git/commits/3976c6a13ff7152d4c531fa06c597a59f7dd2579","verification":{"payload":"tree faa7726122b8de4490c1c4aab7b49b8a8522c635\nparent 2f47841c69a3d9b758bb00963bd98c1605feb343\nauthor JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1754602307 +0200\ncommitter JackatDJL <71508487+JackatDJL@users.noreply.github.com> 1754602307 +0200\ngitbutler-headers-version 2\ngitbutler-change-id 221a31d4-e541-4249-a1c6-b8658e0508ef\n\nwrote the job\n\nIntroduce a new GitHub Actions job to build and run Docker containers\nfor Ubuntu and Windows test environments. This ensures consistent and\nisolated testing across these platforms. Remove macOS Docker support due\nto licensing and practical limitations. Update the test summary to\ninclude Docker test results and adjust the test runner script to reflect\nthe supported platforms. These changes improve test coverage and\nreliability in CI workflows.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEPe7opfFXBbOntsY/zhGGnpWe2kEFAmiVG0MACgkQzhGGnpWe\n2kFAlA/7B8ik7kqhZ56vQj+8LfRr0G/4WgfWZ2V7067sQvdsMbVsiP+nOFl7uyvS\n8xkPafpJ/f82SmSVJi5YyblAvf84CAlMkpuJ32yCUdcPjsmibCz/ruvy97o0iOO/\nY5wr9gdTIrUKOWgL3H8x8KLwrrYrYAMKb+XPbGDPZHsQCynJL92e/4pGxH+QnBx/\nQCkoJhHLFlv/HLZetTVw+CQafGZyY6rX5zh2UIpAphryiyVhtlD/oR70CRgVJdrr\nNQwNjbvhVFk2KqDWn0MznQ2atzLvHDktQKCOBYb+oRWkMNlTZF39MvAp6B5QUcCf\nx7cwKgeLUi9uRYBmbkBnjjvI/Xx9FBsfjq+2QSP3l2cvfL8rJTVMr6WD2vk4vS3p\nUmLwC719ZKLc0XrfKPyAGSX5Mq6aZXCckbEDB4GmF3MsnZkBogsxTa9UrTojMr1+\ntf/Keodo77cTwFMfZh8Hv1K6lH1HIbt/Y4u5d6I65gF/esAr00ElXxDiPKGR7if9\nszhjezGYKQ5hUzFE4yv+29yw4CgqpvA7gZ6EItr3XJNKyt4FB2xujEyYPVakeK+S\nugpqxRFAM+ivrSCfE2497gJGrCGQwQq5jk5syptRVI9P+RCDT5/i+UkwXZTYnTlJ\ncCHXfPuhTWu3b6X7UiAoFFjatv8OAwL5VT8f/l4yfkkL4fIoey0=\n=Xe9A\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_