ing in CI workflow\n\nUpdate the rust-ci-cd.yml workflow to fix parsing of keyword\narrays in PowerShell scripts. Replace the previous syntax with\nConvertFrom-Json using a single-quoted string to properly parse the\ninstallation and deinstallation keyword lists. This ensures the log\nchecks correctly identify expected keywords during install and uninstall\nsteps.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEPe7opfFXBbOntsY/zhGGnpWe2kEFAmiTzDwACgkQzhGGnpWe\n2kGA5w//SvkOv6oRK7n4dN8jQ/u+0hER1vFvoaol2MiGju5fX4PuCzWmMpg0YS+y\ng0FrmlFRfDtTOpLQkPWqUdJVTek1KKCZwgedxgYLfwWuj/n9t4m0cn8i6595lyuK\njxEE6YSquYmX+Q5zIlnhZ5poOxAMY34aRQb0nfc+aCpSSybD6hlMsnWNfXeWeZFU\nJ0mH9vAEuUEkSgNvcgWTEJ2gyeHv9bdKddrecq9XjbnjDB8W2aMFx+LHgePlpPX0\nwU6NCvUrIPYhNrrhlogTyuKCLqYXUTpTFGdgV+/y0IUCBzOgQjXueUVIl923I5Da\nkO7mPTqFjfsp0XjwDAIyOvmTJuLxZ2tFtXVUOUQtmnYfdr+VGWve2N0uZVsxDiS1\nW8BR+LiQWPSBgPJDZtYtcgOjmLRWLWYkEzZkqxb9eqXStuefjtwIpdr37qKIK8iy\naQTiBOCCnUfmC0UnpUqOzpeyfEVWw7Hhfg97dtPiQsNNbeZVorWi17IwhkcAjKR9\nmeTg8GGPBiUTR5SukFJsREv2nXVRF++aH0Gjgi8X6zdBdquQDvTEWpJiPc2X9lIm\n9ISBgI7zKWHe91rgh9yhBlQGq/LCUiN67S0V2ftHTxqfsf/lql+9HtPnktua4X3x\ngNkmUX9kIe/zM8VhUtoLeQQEFiGgB5hrI0u4YDc3wKFBEOPRrgE=\n=GAcw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-08-06T21:42:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71508487?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JackatDJL","id":71508487,"login":"JackatDJL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNTA4NDg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JackatDJL/repos",