h Zustand slice pattern\n\n- Set up monorepo structure with npm workspaces and Lerna\n- Implement lightweight micro-frontend approach using Next.js proxy\n- Add Zustand state management with slice pattern for modular state\n- Create shared package with Layout component and global store\n- Implement Shell App (Next.js 15) with App Router and SSR support\n- Implement Remote App (Vite) with React Router\n- Add theme persistence with Cookie sync for SSR\n- Create comprehensive documentation for architecture and development\n- Add example components demonstrating global/local state usage\n\nKey features:\n- Global state shared across micro-apps via localStorage\n- App-specific stores for local state management\n- TypeScript support with full type safety\n- Dark mode with SSR-friendly implementation\n- Modular slice pattern for scalable state management","tree":{"sha":"e08b21349c270d9d3a2c285814005e008d650b45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/do4way/monorepo-micro-frontend/git/trees/e08b21349c270d9d3a2c285814005e008d650b45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/do4way/monorepo-micro-frontend/git/commits/f9cfb1fa618da15be28e8fad41c29a1a6b8c5c6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/924654?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/do4way/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/do4way/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/do4way/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/do4way/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/do4way","id":924654,"login":"do4way","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyNDY1NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/do4way/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/do4way/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/do4way/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/do4wa