mail":"arun.manmathan@gmail.com","name":"Arun Manmathan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-20T11:43:52Z","email":"arun.manmathan@gmail.com","name":"Arun Manmathan"},"message":"feat: Integrate spaCy NLP service for enhanced skill extraction\n\nThis commit integrates a new spaCy NLP service to enhance the skill extraction capabilities of the user-service. The spaCy service provides more accurate and comprehensive skill identification from resume text.\n\nThe following changes were made:\n\n- Removed the `backend/spacy-service` directory, as the service is assumed to be running independently.\n- Modified `backend/user-service/src/main/java/com/skilllens/service/ResumeParseService.java` to call the spaCy service via its API endpoint to extract skills.\n- Added logic to handle the response from the spaCy service and merge the extracted skills with those extracted by the existing SkillMatcherService.\n- Added necessary dependencies (ObjectMapper) and configurations (URL) to facilitate communication with the spaCy service.","tree":{"sha":"69733fd9b2b2c3c4f2f4e0b40f69733289df203c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/git/trees/69733fd9b2b2c3c4f2f4e0b40f69733289df203c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/git/commits/ffa5f678d8e5b55629c724ed7dafc7b48d8dc926","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120103027?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArunrajR1987","id":120103027,"login":"ArunrajR1987","node_id":"U_kgDOByigcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arunraj