/api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/commits/cf7861a063fba1e914db6b4aed72b9ff4f52f8e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-18T11:13:06Z","email":"arun.manmathan@gmail.com","name":"Arun Manmathan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-18T11:13:06Z","email":"arun.manmathan@gmail.com","name":"Arun Manmathan"},"message":"feat: Enhance user profile management and UI components\n\nThis commit enhances the user profile management feature in the user frontend by adding search functionality, improving UI components with Material UI, and refactoring the profile list.\n\n- **apps/user-frontend:**\n  - Adds `@mui/icons-material` as a dependency.\n  - Updates `App.tsx` to rename `ProfileList` to `ProfilesPage`.\n  - Modifies `ProfileList.tsx` to implement search functionality, display a loading indicator, and handle empty profile lists. It also replaces the previous profile display with `ProfileCard` components.\n  - Updates `ResumeUpload.tsx` to use Material UI components for a more consistent and visually appealing UI.\n  - Introduces `ProfileCard.tsx` (new file) to display individual profile information.","tree":{"sha":"0fada8f89a84ccb62841ef89d2c83491daa3ef73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/git/trees/0fada8f89a84ccb62841ef89d2c83491daa3ef73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/git/commits/cf7861a063fba1e914db6b4aed72b9ff4f52f8e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120103027?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArunrajR1987","id":120103027,"login":"ArunrajR1987","node_id":"U_kgDOByigcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/commit/cf7861a063fba1e914db6b4aed72b9ff4f52f8e6","node_id":"C_kwDOPXujCtoAKGNmNzg2MWEwNjNmYmExZTkxNGRiNmI0YWVkNzJiOWZmNGY1MmY4ZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/commit/454a05fb13773564634ac5de99ff51fb69b7c15a","sha":"454a05fb13773564634ac5de99ff51fb69b7c15a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/commits/454a05fb13773564634ac5de99ff51fb69b7c15a"}],"sha":"cf7861a063fba1e914db6b4aed72b9ff4f52f8e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/commits/cf7861a063fba1e914db6b4aed72b9ff4f52f8e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120103027?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArunrajR1987","id":120103027,"login":"ArunrajR1987","node_id":"U_kgDOByigcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/commits/454a05fb13773564634ac5de99ff51fb69b7c15a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-17T23:33:34Z","email":"arun.manmathan@gmail.com","name":"Arun Manmathan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-17T23:33:34Z","email":"arun.manmathan@gmail.com","name":"Arun Manmathan"},"message":"feat: Integrate Apollo Client for GraphQL and refine CORS configuration\n\nThis commit integrates Apollo Client in the user frontend to consume GraphQL API and refines the CORS configuration in the user service to allow all origins during development.\n\n- **apps/user-frontend:**\n  - Installs `@apollo/client`, `@emotion/react`, `@emotion/styled`, `@mui/material`, `apollo-upload-client`, and `graphql` as dependencies.\n  - Configures Apollo Client to connect to the GraphQL endpoint at `http://localhost:8080/graphql`.\n  - Wraps the `App` component with `ApolloProvider` to provide the Apollo Client instance.\n  - Moves `ProfileList` component to `src/features/profiles/ProfileList.tsx`.\n- **backend/user-service:**\n  - Configures GraphQL servlet mapping and enables GraphiQL in `application.yml`.\n  - Removes the custom `CorsFilter` bean and configures CORS using `CorsConfiguration` to allow all origins, headers, and methods for development purposes in `CorsConfig.java`.\n  - Removes unused `CorsFilter` bean from `UserServiceApplication.java`.\n  - Refactors `ResumeParseService.java` to use constructor injection.\n  - Adds a blank line to `UserProfileResolver.java`.","tree":{"sha":"e40056fd98d0de07099e9af2b99bb49fe0269555","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/git/trees/e40056fd98d0de07099e9af2b99bb49fe0269555"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/git/commits/454a05fb13773564634ac5de99ff51fb69b7c15a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120103027?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArunrajR1987","id":120103027,"login":"ArunrajR1987","node_id":"U_kgDOByigcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/commit/454a05fb13773564634ac5de99ff51fb69b7c15a","node_id":"C_kwDOPXujCtoAKDQ1NGEwNWZiMTM3NzM1NjQ2MzRhYzVkZTk5ZmY1MWZiNjliN2MxNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/commit/d6029c222c5259e2643c277617995306b1c7398e","sha":"d6029c222c5259e2643c277617995306b1c7398e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/commits/d6029c222c5259e2643c277617995306b1c7398e"}],