.com/users/ArunrajR1987/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/commits/df7dfbae9ff9fd96aa9315296ab9c7ec95f8ae51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-12T14:47:55Z","email":"arun.manmathan@gmail.com","name":"Arun Manmathan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-12T14:47:55Z","email":"arun.manmathan@gmail.com","name":"Arun Manmathan"},"message":"feat: Implement user frontend with resume upload and profile listing\n\nThis commit introduces the user frontend application, enabling users to upload resumes and view a list of profiles with associated skills.\n\n- Implemented the main application structure using React, React Router, and Tailwind CSS.\n- Created a ResumeUpload component for uploading resumes, including fields for name, role, and GitHub URL.  The component sends the resume file and user details to the backend API.\n- Developed a ProfileList component to display a list of user profiles fetched from the backend API.  This component also includes a pie chart visualizing the distribution of skills among the profiles using recharts.\n- Integrated React Query for efficient data fetching and caching in the ProfileList component.\n- Added a .gitignore file to exclude unnecessary files and directories from version control.\n- Included necessary dependencies in package.json, such as react, react-router-dom, axios, @tanstack/react-query, recharts, autoprefixer, postcss, and tailwindcss.","tree":{"sha":"e9c160bc16376d2601f9b60d9d876f8dad9989ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/git/trees/e9c160bc16376d2601f9b60d9d876f8dad9989ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/git/commits/df7dfbae9ff9fd96aa9315296ab9c7ec95f8ae51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"