"arun.manmathan@gmail.com","name":"Arun Manmathan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-10T22:22:28Z","email":"arun.manmathan@gmail.com","name":"Arun Manmathan"},"message":"feat: Enhance user-service with profile management and resume parsing\n\nThis commit enhances the user-service with the following features:\n\n- Implements asynchronous resume parsing using Apache Tika to extract text content.\n- Integrates with OpenAI API (mocked with keyword matching) to identify skills from the resume content.\n- Fetches GitHub repositories for a user and extracts languages used to enrich skills.\n- Adds endpoints for retrieving all user profiles and deleting a user profile.\n- Introduces JPA for persistence and enables asynchronous method execution.\n- Updates the `UserProfile` model to include `githubUrl` and `resumeText` fields.\n- Updates docker-compose.yml to include user-service.","tree":{"sha":"9ee341b00e1887bbee9e65922138ee16e6644fde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/git/trees/9ee341b00e1887bbee9e65922138ee16e6644fde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/git/commits/f582880b52b6c2b03cb3ce0593f0dcca938ed984","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120103027?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArunrajR1987","id":120103027,"login":"ArunrajR1987","node_id":"U_kgDOByigcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR198