,"email":"arun.manmathan@gmail.com","name":"Arun Manmathan"},"message":"feat: Implement user-service backend with resume upload and profile retrieval\n\nThis commit introduces the user-service backend, providing endpoints for:\n\n- Uploading a user''s resume for asynchronous parsing.\n- Retrieving a user profile by ID.\n\nKey components include:\n\n- A Spring Boot application setup with necessary dependencies (web, lombok, JPA).\n- `UserController` exposing `/api/users/upload` (POST) and `api/users/{userId}` (GET) endpoints.\n- `ResumeParseService` simulating asynchronous resume parsing.\n- `UserProfile` model for user data.\n- Dockerfile for containerization.\n- .gitignore to exclude unnecessary files.","tree":{"sha":"2c73ff71dc913e54abac1522dce973d45a84d861","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/git/trees/2c73ff71dc913e54abac1522dce973d45a84d861"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArunrajR1987/skill-lens/git/commits/2cc3b65e5808eeac7757c452972697f1f4595bf9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120103027?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ArunrajR1987","id":120103027,"login":"ArunrajR1987","node_id":"U_kgDOByigcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArunrajR1987/subscriptions"